# hotels_data.jsonl and chromadb/ are committed on purpose: the Render free plan has no
# persistent disk, so the backend seeds its catalogue from these files on every deploy
# instead of relying on runtime storage (see render.yaml).
# Personal working/interview-prep notes (talking points, "what to say if asked X") never
# belong in user-doc/ or elsewhere in tracked docs, even when the underlying technical
# content is fine to keep public — put them here instead.
